# Design system — Ant Design

Read `.arlox/design-system.json` — this project uses **Ant Design** (`antd`).

## Rules

- Import UI from `antd` — Button, Form, Table, Input, Card, Modal, etc.
- Use Tailwind only for page layout (flex, spacing, width) — not for component styling.
- Forms: use `Form`, `Form.Item`, and antd inputs — not raw HTML inputs.
- Do not mix shadcn, MUI, or Chakra in the same project.

